'''Ministros''' hop around the room aimlessly but will hop in the general direction of Isaac if he gets too close. They will occasionally pause to spit a disorganized cluster of projectiles akin to [[Monstro]]. Ministros are unlocked by defeating [[The Lamb]] for the first time.

== Notes ==
* {{Dlc|a+nr}} When Ministros are [[champion]]s, their red shots only deal half a heart of damage, but they still deal a full heart of contact damage.
* If Ministros aren't unlocked yet, they are replaced by [[Hopper]]s.
* [[Monstro]] is the boss version of Ministros.

== Trivia ==
* The name 'Ministro' is both a portmanteau of 'mini' and 'Monstro' and the Italian/spanish/portuguese word for 'minister'.
* Older version of this mob didn't have a jumping animation and was just crawling instead.
